## Figure captions (your thesis style, compressed)

Thesis figure captions are long and descriptive. PLOS captions: **title + panels + one interpretation sentence + source**.

```
\textbf{[What the figure shows].}
\textbf{A,} [content]. \textbf{B,} [content].
[One sentence: main takeaway for the reader.]
[Optional: fold, seed, K, scope.]
```

