## Quality checklist (voice)

- [ ] Sounds like thesis §5 (interpreted numbers) not generic AI prose
- [ ] Every Results paragraph has **scope** (joint/within-lab/fold) in sentence 1 or 2
- [ ] British spelling throughout
- [ ] No paragraph >6 sentences
- [ ] Mechanistic sentence follows each table/figure claim
- [ ] Thesis LOSO / expert-feature results cited only as **contrast**, not as paper headline
- [ ] Limitations inline (REM, lab 2/5, seed fragility, incomplete HMM raw) — thesis §5.9 style, one clause each
